<title>USA: Tarrant Apparel Group Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Tarrant Apparel Group Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.41		    $0.21</p>
<p> Net			  2,745		    1,371</p>
<p> Net sales		 68,889		   44,192</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,663		    6,500</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>			  Year</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.53		    $1.06</p>
<p> Net			 10,002		    5,674</p>
<p> Net sales		229,861		  205,174</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,548		    5,353</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 year includes non-recurring charge of about $0.32/shr related to a grant by the company's original shareholders to an affiliate of The Limited Inc of an option to purchase about 10 pct of Tarrant stock.</p>
<p>1995 year net income of $5,674,000 is a pro forma amount which has been presented before adjustment to eliminate the non-recurring charge related to LDA option as explained above.</p>
